{"id": "1dabc677-8ece-4c3e-aae7-9f9e3afe9ab7", "slug": "design-documentation-production", "title": "Design Documentation & Production", "description": "Design Documentation Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Design Documentation & Production\"\ndescription: \"Design Documentation Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#0052FF\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#3375FF\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#1A1A1A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#242424\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Design Documentation & Production\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 20; favorites: 6; remixes: 3.\nTags: pricing, section, animated, bento, billing, cta.\n## Overview\nDesign Documentation Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nCaleb Edit ⌘ E Duplicate ⌘ D Delete ⌫ Jake Martin Let's get organized with the task We transform scattered inputs into structured technical requirements and a clear, workable design plan, ensuring every concept is pract…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Let's get organized with the task; We design in CAD according to the standard; We release the design documentation ready for production; Checking the numbers.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #0052FF, secondary #000000, accent #3375FF, background #000000, surface #1A1A1A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Design Documentation & Production</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP for Animations -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Custom Tailwind Configuration for exact colors and utilities -->\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        background: '#040404',\n                        surface: '#0A0A0A',\n                        surfaceLight: '#111111',\n                        border: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)',\n                        brand: '#0052FF',\n                        brandLight: '#3375FF',\n                    },\n                    backgroundImage: {\n                        'grid-pattern': `linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px)`,\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-background text-white font-sans antialiased min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8 lg:p-12 overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-brand/30\">\n\n    <!-- Main Bento Grid Container -->\n    <main class=\"max-w-[1200px] w-full mx-auto\">\n        <!-- Grid Wrapper with 1px gaps acting as inner borders -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_1fr] grid-rows-auto gap-[1px] bg-border border border-border overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <!-- PANEL 1: Collaborative (Left, Tall) -->\n            <div class=\"bg-surface relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden min-h-[500px] lg:min-h-full lg:row-span-2 group\">\n                <!-- Grid Background -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-grid-pattern [background-size:30px_30px] opacity-40 mix-blend-screen pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Top Graphic Area -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-[350px] p-6 pt-12\">\n\n                    <!-- Fake Blueprint Element Base -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[280px] h-[200px] border border-white/10 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm -rotate-6 flex flex-col p-3 shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\">\n                        <!-- Simulated blueprint lines -->\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 border-b border-white/5 relative\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-[20%] w-[1px] bg-white/5\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-[30%] w-[1px] bg-white/5\"></div>\n                            <!-- Small structural circles -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-[30%] left-[10%] w-3 h-3 border border-white/20 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[20%] right-[20%] w-4 h-4 border border-white/20 rounded-full\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Cursor 1 (Caleb) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[15%] left-[15%] flex flex-col items-center gap-1 z-10 drop-shadow-lg\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-linear\" class=\"text-brandLight text-xl rotate-[-20deg] drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(51,117,255,0.5)]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"bg-brand text-white text-[10px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">Caleb</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Context Menu -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[30%] left-[45%] bg-[#1A1A1A]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-1.5 w-40 z-20 shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transform transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer text-xs text-brandLight group/item\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pen-linear\"></iconify-icon> Edit</div>\n                            <span class=\"text-white/30 text-[10px] group-hover/item:text-white/50\">⌘ E</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer text-xs text-white/80 group/item\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:copy-linear\"></iconify-icon> Duplicate</div>\n                            <span class=\"text-white/30 text-[10px] group-hover/item:text-white/50\">⌘ D</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"h-[1px] bg-white/5 my-1 mx-2\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer text-xs text-white/80 group/item\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:trash-bin-trash-linear\"></iconify-icon> Delete</div>\n                            <span class=\"text-white/30 text-[10px] group-hover/item:text-white/50\">⌫</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Cursor 2 (Jake) - near context menu -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[48%] left-[40%] flex flex-col items-center gap-1 z-30 drop-shadow-lg\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-linear\" class=\"text-brandLight text-xl rotate-[-20deg] drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(51,117,255,0.5)]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"bg-brand text-white text-[10px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">Jake</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                     <!-- Cursor 3 (Martin) -->\n                     <div class=\"absolute bottom-[5%] left-[20%] flex flex-col items-center gap-1 z-10 drop-shadow-lg\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-linear\" class=\"text-brandLight text-xl rotate-[-20deg] drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(51,117,255,0.5)]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"bg-brand text-white text-[10px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">Martin</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Text Content -->\n                <div class=\"p-8 lg:p-10 relative z-10\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-[22px] leading-tight tracking-tight font-medium text-white mb-3\">Let's get organized with the task</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed reveal-text max-w-[90%]\">We transform scattered inputs into structured technical requirements and a clear, workable design plan, ensuring every concept is practical, buildable, and ready for real world implementation</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- PANEL 2: CAD App (Top Middle) -->\n            <div class=\"bg-surface relative flex flex-col p-8 lg:p-10 min-h-[400px] overflow-hidden group\">\n                <!-- Top Menu Mockup -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500 mb-12 tracking-wide\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 bg-white/10 px-2 py-1 rounded text-white\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono bg-brand text-white px-1 rounded-sm\">SW</span></div>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\">File</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Edit</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Render</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Window</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Help</span>\n                    <span class=\"ml-auto hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Layout</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Modeling</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- App Dock -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-max mx-auto mt-4 mb-auto\">\n                    <!-- Premium Border Gradient for Dock -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent -m-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#141414] rounded-2xl p-4 flex items-center gap-4 shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)]\">\n\n                        <!-- Inactive Icon -->\n                        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white/20\">A</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Active Icon (SW) -->\n                        <div class=\"relative w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-brand flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,82,255,0.4)] border-t border-white/30 transform transition-transform group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-transparent rounded-2xl pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white flex flex-col leading-none items-center\">\n                                <span>S</span><span>W</span>\n                            </span>\n                            <!-- Cursor interacting -->\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-linear\" class=\"absolute -bottom-3 -right-3 text-white text-xl rotate-[-20deg] drop-shadow-md\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Inactive Icon -->\n                         <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white/20\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Inactive Icon -->\n                        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white/20\">A</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Text Content -->\n                <div class=\"mt-auto pt-8\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-[20px] leading-tight tracking-tight font-medium text-white mb-2\">We design in CAD according to the standard</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed reveal-text\">We create scalable parametric 3D models and clear CAD drawings as a universal language for precise collaboration</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- PANEL 3: Documentation (Top Right) -->\n            <div class=\"bg-surface relative flex flex-col p-8 lg:p-10 min-h-[400px] overflow-hidden group\">\n                <!-- Visual Area -->\n                <div class=\"relative h-[220px] w-full mt-4 flex justify-center perspective-[1000px]\">\n                    <!-- Folders Background Layer -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 w-[60%] h-12 bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-t-xl border-t border-x border-white/10 opacity-40 translate-y-4 translate-x-4\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-4 w-[70%] h-12 bg-[#1C1C1C] rounded-t-xl border-t border-x border-white/10 opacity-60 translate-y-4 translate-x-2\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Main Folders Container -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-[85%] mt-8 z-10 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                        <!-- BOM Folder -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 flex items-center shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transform transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-neutral-400\">BOM</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Drawings Folder -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#1F1F1F] border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 flex items-center shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transform transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-2\">\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">Drawings</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Materials Folder container -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-20\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#242424] border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-4 flex items-center shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)]\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-white\">Materials</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Floating Blue Blueprint File -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute -right-4 -top-16 w-32 h-24 bg-brand/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg border border-brandLight/50 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,82,255,0.4)] rotate-[15deg] overflow-hidden p-2 flex flex-col gap-1 transform transition-all duration-700 ease-out group-hover:rotate-[10deg] group-hover:-translate-y-4 group-hover:-translate-x-2\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-1/3 border-b border-white/20 relative\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 left-1 w-1/2 h-[2px] bg-white/30 rounded\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full flex-1 border border-white/10 rounded-sm mt-1 bg-white/5\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Small Status Footer -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-4 text-[10px] text-neutral-500 flex items-center gap-3 font-medium tracking-wide\">\n                        <span>Files <span class=\"text-white\">68</span></span>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                            Status <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white ml-1\"></span> <span class=\"text-white\">Production-ready</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Text Content -->\n                <div class=\"mt-auto pt-8 relative z-30\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-[20px] leading-tight tracking-tight font-medium text-white mb-2\">We release the design documentation ready for production</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed reveal-text\">We deliver complete documentation with drawings, specs, and revisions, so production runs smoothly without guesswork or rework</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- PANEL 4: Calculator / Numbers (Bottom Wide) -->\n            <div class=\"bg-surface relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden min-h-[450px] md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 group\">\n                <!-- Grid Background -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-grid-pattern [background-size:40px_40px] opacity-30 mix-blend-screen pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Ruler Graphic -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[40%] left-0 right-1/2 h-8 border-t border-b border-white/10 flex items-end px-8 z-10 opacity-50\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-full flex items-end justify-between border-b border-white/20 pb-1\">\n                        <!-- Tick marks generated via inline styles for precision -->\n                        <div class=\"text-[8px] text-neutral-500 font-mono flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"h-2 w-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>7</div>\n                        <div class=\"h-1 w-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[8px] text-neutral-500 font-mono flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"h-2 w-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>8</div>\n                        <div class=\"h-1 w-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[8px] text-neutral-500 font-mono flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"h-2 w-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>9</div>\n                        <div class=\"h-1 w-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[8px] text-neutral-500 font-mono flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"h-2 w-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>10</div>\n                        <div class=\"h-1 w-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[8px] text-neutral-500 font-mono flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"h-2 w-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>11</div>\n                        <div class=\"h-1 w-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[8px] text-neutral-500 font-mono flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"h-2 w-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>12</div>\n                        <div class=\"h-1 w-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[8px] text-neutral-500 font-mono flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"h-2 w-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>13</div>\n                        <div class=\"h-1 w-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[8px] text-neutral-500 font-mono flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"h-2 w-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>14</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- 3D Calculator Keyboard UI -->\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-10%] -right-10 md:right-10 lg:right-20 w-[450px] h-[350px] rotate-[-15deg] z-20 transform transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:rotate-[-12deg]\">\n                    <!-- Base Pad -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0F0F0F] rounded-3xl border-t border-l border-white/5 shadow-[20px_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),_inset_0px_2px_4px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Subtle texture/pattern on pad -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(#fff_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:4px_4px]\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Logo/Brand marking -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-6 right-8 text-neutral-600 font-medium tracking-widest text-lg flex items-center gap-2 opacity-40\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon> KONTUR\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Keypad Grid -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-8 right-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n                            <!-- Standard Dark Keys -->\n                            <div class=\"h-16 rounded-xl bg-[#1A1A1A] border-t border-white/10 border-b-[4px] border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[0_4px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:bg-[#222] hover:border-b-[2px] hover:translate-y-[2px] transiti